<title>JAPAN: Tokyo prosecutors questioning former DKB VP - NHK.</title>
<headline>Tokyo prosecutors questioning former DKB VP - NHK.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tokyo prosecutors are questioning a former vice president of Dai-Ichi Kangyo Bank Ltd in connection with a racketeer payoff scandal, public broadcaster NHK said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
